{"suttaId":"sn25.6","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[1150,1150],"vripara":"307"},"segments":{"sn25.6:0.3":"Rūpasaññāsuttaṃ","sn25.6:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn25.6:1.2":"“Rūpasaññā, bhikkhave, aniccā vipariṇāmī aññathābhāvī;","sn25.6:1.3":"saddasaññā … gandhasaññā … rasasaññā … phoṭṭhabbasaññā … dhammasaññā aniccā vipariṇāmī aññathābhāvī.","sn25.6:1.8":"Yo, bhikkhave, ime dhamme evaṃ saddahati adhimuccati, ayaṃ vuccati ‘saddhānusārī … pe … sambodhiparāyano’”ti.","sn25.6:1.10":"Chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":449,"to":451,"paras":[{"para":449,"vripara":"302-311","refs":["sn25.6:1"],"lines":["302-311. Okkantasaṃyutte <b>adhimuccatī</b>ti saddhādhimokkhaṃ paṭilabhati.","<b>Okkanto sammattaniyāman</b>ti paviṭṭho ariyamaggaṃ.","<b>Abhabbo ca tāva kālaṃ kātun</b>ti iminā uppanne magge phalassa anantarāyataṃ dīpeti.","Uppannasmiñhi magge phalassa antarāyakaraṇaṃ nāma natthi.","Tenevāha –","“ayañca puggalo sotāpattiphalasacchikiriyāya paṭipanno assa, kappassa ca uḍḍayhanavelā assa, neva tāva kappo uḍḍayheyya, yāvāyaṃ puggalo na sotāpattiphalaṃ sacchikaroti, ayaṃ vuccati puggalo ṭhitakappī”ti (pu. pa.17).","<b>Mattaso nijjhānaṃ khamantī</b>ti pamāṇato olokanaṃ khamanti.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"]]},{"para":450,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Okkantasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":451,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn25.6:1"],"lines":["Uppādasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn25.6:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":472,"to":475,"paras":[{"para":472,"vripara":"302-311","refs":["sn25.6:1"],"lines":["302-311. <b>Saddhādhimokkhan</b>ti saddahanavasena pavattaṃ adhimokkhaṃ, na sanniṭṭhānamattavasena pavattaṃ adhimokkhaṃ.","Dassanampi sammattaṃ, taṃsijjhānavasena pavattaniyāmo <b>sammattaniyāmo,</b> ariyamaggo.","<b>Anantarāyataṃ dīpeti</b> kappavināsapaṭibhāgena pavattattā.","Tathā cāha <b>“tenevāhā”</b>tiādi.","Kappasīsena bhājanalokaṃ vadati.","So hi uḍḍayhati, na kappo, <b>uḍḍayhanavelā</b>ti jhāyanavelā.","Ṭhito kappo ṭhitakappo, so assa atthīti <b>ṭhitakappī,</b> kappaṃ ṭhapetuṃ samatthoti attho.","<b>Olokanan</b>ti saccābhisamayasaṅkhātaṃ dassanaṃ.","<b>Khamanti</b> sahanti, ñāyantīti attho."],"lineRefs":[["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"],["sn25.6:1"]]},{"para":473,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Cakkhusuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":474,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Okkantasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":475,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn25.6:1"],"lines":["Uppādasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn25.6:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]}}
